Read-only query against synthetic PostgreSQL 15.18 (exit 0):

SELECT rolname, has_table_privilege(rolname,'users','UPDATE'), has_table_privilege(rolname,'operating_context_grants','UPDATE'), has_table_privilege(rolname,'platform_municipalities','UPDATE'), has_table_privilege(rolname,'service_routes','UPDATE') FROM pg_roles WHERE rolname IN ('civicmaps_local_app','civicmaps_platform_app','civicmaps_provisioning_worker') ORDER BY rolname;
