Results: `civicmaps_local_app|f|f|f|f`; `civicmaps_platform_app|f|f|t|f`; `civicmaps_provisioning_worker|f|f|f|f`. No role membership rows were returned. The platform app has table UPDATE on platform municipalities as expected; service-route access uses narrower column grants, so this table-level UPDATE query is false. This is a local synthetic state observation, not a deployment inventory.
